                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
<p>
   <lb n="1"/>… ta vraḥ …
   <lb n="2"/>… roh vraḥ śāsana man vraḥ kalpa[nā] …
   <lb n="3"/>… vvaṁ thve toy roh vraḥ śāsana nau A…
   <lb n="4"/>… qnak ta mān bhaktiy phoṅ cāpp neḥ qnāk ta …
   <lb n="5"/>… ṇagar pi kaṁsteṅ rājakula paṅgaṁ thp[vaṅ] …
   <lb n="6"/>…n jaṁnvan vāp Arjuṇa vāp …
</p>
                   <lg n="1" met="anuṣṭubh">
<l n="a"><lb n="7"/>= = = = ⏑ lumpeyur<space/></l>
<l n="b">llaṅghayeyuś ca śā[sanam]</l>
<l n="c"><lb n="8"/>= = = = ⏑ - - =</l>
<l n="d">= tau candradivākarau <g ref="sym:bullet-hollow" type="punctuation">.</g></l>
</lg>
                   <p>                    
   <lb n="9"/>… ri …
   <lb n="10"/>… vraḥ …
                   </p>
</div>
